From: gongyueetree <eelib0418@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 05:31:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(pub_api): designs by circuit module, filters, vendor
 name, cover images and PCB previews, footprint in part lists
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

For Tindie Discover (Open hardware by module with pictures; openable open-source designs with >=1
star plus all vendor reference designs; PCB planner lists only parts that have a footprint).

- GET /api/pub/v1/designs?function=<module id> (includes sub-modules, via oshw_bom_modules)
- min_stars, eda (comma separated) filters applied before paging, so totals stay correct; they
  constrain open-source designs only — vendor reference designs are always kept
- design list items carry cover_image_url (repo social image / README image), board_preview, and
  vendor for vendor designs (from project_category, e.g. "TI 参考设计" -> "TI")
- GET /api/pub/v1/designs/{id}/board.svg: the PCB preview oshw_cover generated (signed, CSP)
- parts/search and parts/lookup items carry footprint (withheld when it has a pending conflict);
  with_footprint=1 returns only parts with a footprint

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018MWFKK7DmS3uJmhqWTQfJ4
